  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Z2BN6Y6/banner.png\" alt=\"模組橫幅 - Genshin Instruments\" width=\"768\" height=\"283\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>將《原神》的一系列樂器加入您的《我的世界》體驗中，並使用熟悉的鍵位演奏您最喜愛的歌曲！<br>想要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/even-more-instruments\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多樂器</a>嗎？👀<br>(初次接觸演奏？請查看<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fblog%252fhow-to-master-the-lyre-genshin-instruments-mod%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">這篇實用的教學</a>)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_m7oIwfqpPI?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>完整 MIDI 支援！</strong></h2>\n<p><em><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WaCIP4lWEzk?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7PKk7qorFTk?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IMJbt353j9o?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></em></p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">本模組為遊戲新增以下樂器：</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>風神之琴</strong> [立體聲支援]</li>\n<li><strong>花籠之笛</strong> [舊版 &amp; 新版]</li>\n<li><strong>古式大提琴</strong> [標準化支援]<strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong>荒瀧太鼓</strong></li>\n<li><strong>夜風之角</strong> [永續模式]</li>\n<li><strong>烏克麗麗</strong> [和弦轉高音支援]</li>\n<li><strong>傑傑鼓</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>樂器紋理由強大的 Gen 製作！歡迎前往欣賞其作品並給予支持 😋</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fGenMode\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fgen%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">PlanetMinecraft</a> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/GenMedia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> | <a href=\"https://twitter.com/DatapackGen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br>功能支援：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>各樂器可自訂音高，以半音為單位遞增</li>\n<li>可透過左 Shift 鍵與 Alt 鍵調整移調（依您的鍵位設定）</li>\n<li>多種音符標籤套件（含對應您語言與鍵盤配置的標籤、樂譜記號等！）</li>\n<li>多人遊戲與共用樂器介面！</li>\n<li>完整 MIDI 支援！</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>⚠️ 重要 ⚠️：本模組作者已結束此專案</strong></h2>\n<p>請觀看下方影片了解更多詳情：</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TUzdklT4vcs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>內容焦點</strong></h2>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1CVVqa2BHVE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bCLnB21RSj4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lzwnBKp6Pg0?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Gvs3MRvkJR4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>（上方影片由 <a href=\"https://github.com/k5md/M2KB\" rel=\"nofollow\">M2KB</a> 專案協助製作）</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>您是創作者嗎？或是彈奏風神之琴的玩家？</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">歡迎透過 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/private-messages/send?recipient=stavwasplays\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge 私人訊息</a> 聯繫我，您的影片將在<strong>此處</strong>進行展示！</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>風神之琴<br></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fMDz9ul.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>古式大提琴</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Dtbc6lk.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>花籠之笛</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cMR8lkA.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>荒瀧太鼓</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/165Cjnf.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>夜風之角<br></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bY07PUc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本專案與 HoYoverse 或《原神》無任何隸屬關係。</p>\n<p>所有音訊資產與設計元素均歸該公司所有。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><br>這最初只是一個小型的學習測試專案，如今卻成了我首次發表的作品。身為一名普通的《我的世界》與《原神》玩家，能與社群分享這份作品讓我感到非常興奮與榮幸 :^)</p>",
